id: full-power-super-saiyan-pinnacle-of-legacy
name: Pinnacle of Legacy
order: 8
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: super-saiyan-style-traits
groupLabel: Super Saiyan Style Traits
# (2) "Additionally, this Transformation gains the Armored Aspect" - while in the Undying State.
grantsAspectTo: This = Armored if inState("undying")
description: >
  You represent the very beginnings of a proud line of warriors that spans all of known history, and the power you've awakened proves it.
text: >
  Pinnacle of Legacy: You represent the very beginnings of a proud line of warriors that spans all of known history, and the power you've awakened proves it.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Access to Ancestral Super Saiyan.
  (2)-[Passive]: While you are in the Undying State, increase your Soak Value and Wound Rolls by 2(T). Additionally, this Transformation gains the Armored Aspect.
  (3)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend a stack of Battle Born to use the Power Up Maneuver.
  (4)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: Enter the Undying State until the start of your next turn.

---

# (2) In the Undying State: Soak and Wound 2(T), and the Armored Aspect (its header).
[passive, effect 2]
if (inState("undying")) {
    soakValue += 2(T);
    wound += 2(T);
}

# (3) A stack of Battle Born for the Power Up, once a Round - an Instant of its own (maneuvers/).
[passive, effect 3]
allow maneuver.pinnacle-of-legacy-power-up;

# (4) With the Power Up, once an Encounter: Undying till the start of your next turn.
[triggered/power, 1/encounter, effect 4]
enterState(undying, 1, start-of-next-turn);
